{"id":"110049307881642835","created_at":"2023-03-19T09:46:15.440Z","in_reply_to_id":null,"quote_id":null,"in_reply_to_account_id":null,"sensitive":false,"spoiler_text":"","visibility":"public","language":"en","uri":"https://truthsocial.com/@TulsiGabbard/110049307881642835","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@TulsiGabbard/110049307881642835","content":"<p>16 years after creating the CIA, in an op-ed titled “Limit CIA Role To Intelligence,” President Truman wrote: “For some time I have been disturbed by the way the CIA has been diverted from its original assignment. It has become an operational and at times a policy-making arm of the Government.” We cannot allow any unelected federal agencies/bureaucrats to operate outside the Constitution, undermine our civil liberties, and create their own foreign policies.</p>","account":{"id":"107834674875471949","username":"TulsiGabbard","acct":"TulsiGabbard","display_name":"Tulsi Gabbard","locked":false,"bot":false,"discoverable":true,"group":false,"created_at":"2022-02-21T06:55:57.739Z","note":"<p>Director of National Intelligence.  2020 Presidential candidate. Former Congresswoman. Soldier. Veteran. Surfer.  (Views do not reflect position of Gov/DoD)</p>","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@TulsiGabbard","avatar":"https://static-assets-1.truthsocial.com/tmtg:prime-ts-assets/accounts/avatars/107/834/674/875/471/949/original/6f185d12f4d280eb.jpeg","avatar_static":"https://static-assets-1.truthsocial.com/tmtg:prime-ts-assets/accounts/avatars/107/834/674/875/471/949/original/6f185d12f4d280eb.jpeg","header":"https://static-assets-1.truthsocial.com/tmtg:prime-ts-assets/accounts/headers/107/834/674/875/471/949/original/c543cb563ede4727.jpeg","header_static":"https://static-assets-1.truthsocial.com/tmtg:prime-ts-assets/accounts/headers/107/834/674/875/471/949/original/c543cb563ede4727.jpeg","followers_count":2189124,"following_count":7,"statuses_count":673,"last_status_at":"2026-07-30","verified":true,"location":"Hawaii","website":"www.tulsig